  "details": "<p>The excavators report to <em>Current Archaeology in Turkey</em> that \"the sanctuary ... was in use from the Late Geometric and a monumental temple was built there in the Archaic period. The site was then apparently abandoned until the Hellenistic period. An early Byzantine church was also found at the site.</p>",
